<%# app/views/ig_audience/index.html.erb %>
<% content_for :page_title, "IG 受眾重疊分析" %>

<% unless @data %>
  <div class="alert alert-warning">
    尚無分析資料。請在本機執行 <code>rake ig:audience_analysis</code> 並將結果 JSON 推上來。
  </div>
<% else %>

<%# ── Header ── %>
<div class="row g-3 mb-3">
  <div class="col-12 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-wrap gap-2">
    <div>
      <h4 class="fw-bold mb-0">IG 受眾重疊分析</h4>
      <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/shengting_official" target="_blank" class="text-muted">@shengting_official</a>
        ✕
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/chloechao0527" target="_blank" class="text-muted">@chloechao0527</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <span class="text-muted small">最後更新：<%= @last_updated %></span>
  </div>
</div>

<%# ── 結論摘要（給老闆 & 社群同事） ── %>
<%
  target_count     = @target["count"]
  both_count       = @both["count"]
  chloe_only_count = @chloe_only["count"]
  neither_count    = @neither["count"]
  buyers_total     = target_count + both_count + chloe_only_count + neither_count

  chloe_buyer_pct    = buyers_total > 0 ? (chloe_only_count.to_f / buyers_total * 100).round(1) : 0
  neither_buyer_pct  = buyers_total > 0 ? (neither_count.to_f    / buyers_total * 100).round(1) : 0
  overlap_buyer_pct  = buyers_total > 0 ? (both_count.to_f       / buyers_total * 100).round(1) : 0
%>
<p class="text-uppercase text-muted small fw-bold letter-spacing-1 mb-2">分析結論</p>
<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-4" style="border-left: 4px solid #4a6fa5 !important;">
  <div class="card-body">

    <p class="fw-bold mb-3" style="font-size:1rem">
      在 <%= number_with_delimiter(buyers_total) %> 位有購買紀錄且留有 IG 帳號的客戶中，受眾結構如下：
    </p>

    <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="p-3 rounded" style="background:#fff8e1;">
          <div class="fw-bold mb-1">📌 Chloe 個人帳號的帶購影響力遠大於品牌帳號</div>
          <p class="small mb-0">
            有 <strong><%= number_with_delimiter(chloe_only_count) %> 人（<%= chloe_buyer_pct %>%）</strong>只追蹤 @chloechao0527、沒有追蹤品牌帳號，卻已購買。
            反過來，只追蹤品牌帳號就購買的僅有 <strong><%= target_count %> 人</strong>。
            代表大部分購買決策是被 Chloe 個人影響，品牌帳號對轉換的直接貢獻較小。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="p-3 rounded" style="background:#e8f5e9;">
          <div class="fw-bold mb-1">✅ 核心受眾：兩邊都追蹤的 <%= number_with_delimiter(both_count) %> 人（<%= overlap_buyer_pct %>%）</div>
          <p class="small mb-0">
            同時追蹤 @shengting_official 與 @chloechao0527 且有購買的客戶，是品牌最忠實的一群。
            這群人對兩邊的廣告都會看到，是重複曝光的核心族群，也最容易響應新品或活動通知。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="p-3 rounded" style="background:#fce4ec;">
          <div class="fw-bold mb-1">⚠️ <%= neither_buyer_pct %>% 的買家兩個帳號都沒追蹤</div>
          <p class="small mb-0">
            共 <strong><%= number_with_delimiter(neither_count) %> 人</strong>有購買但不追蹤任何一個帳號，
            可能來自搜尋、直播連結、親友分享等非 IG 管道。
            這群人目前在 IG 上無法被再行銷觸及，值得另外建立 LINE 或 EDM 名單。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="p-3 rounded" style="background:#e3f2fd;">
          <div class="fw-bold mb-1">💡 廣告投放建議</div>
          <p class="small mb-0">
            若 Chloe 廣告與品牌廣告分開投，<strong>應以 Chloe 帳號為主力</strong>——
            她的受眾中有購買行為的人數是品牌帳號的 <%= (chloe_only_count.to_f / [target_count, 1].max).round(0).to_i %> 倍。
            品牌帳號的廣告適合用來做<strong>既有買家的品牌感經營</strong>，而非主要獲客工具。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
      資料來源：Instagram 帳號原生匯出（<%= @last_updated %>）✕ Shopline 客戶購買紀錄。
      比對依據：客戶填寫的 Instagram 帳號欄位（精準比對）。
    </p>

  </div>
</div>

<%# ── 帳號概覽 ── %>
<p class="text-uppercase text-muted small fw-bold letter-spacing-1 mb-2">帳號粉絲概覽</p>
<div class="row g-3 mb-4">
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
      <div class="card-body text-center">
        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">@shengting_official</div>
        <div class="fw-bold" style="font-size:1.5rem"><%= number_with_delimiter(@shengting_followers) %></div>
        <div class="text-muted small">粉絲人數</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
      <div class="card-body text-center">
        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">@chloechao0527</div>
        <div class="fw-bold" style="font-size:1.5rem"><%= number_with_delimiter(@chloe_followers) %></div>
        <div class="text-muted small">粉絲人數</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
      <div class="card-body text-center">
        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">兩帳號粉絲重疊</div>
        <div class="fw-bold text-primary" style="font-size:1.5rem"><%= number_with_delimiter(@overlap_count) %></div>
        <div class="text-muted small">佔品牌粉絲 <%= @overlap_pct %>%</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
      <div class="card-body text-center">
        <div class="text-muted small mb-1">有購買 + 有IG帳號</div>
        <div class="fw-bold text-success" style="font-size:1.5rem"><%= number_with_delimiter(@total_buyers) %></div>
        <div class="text-muted small">Shopline 買家</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%# ── 買家分群 ── %>
<p class="text-uppercase text-muted small fw-bold letter-spacing-1 mb-2">買家分群分析</p>
<div class="row g-3 mb-4">

  <%# 🎯 目標 %>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <a href="<%= ig_audience_path(tab: 'target') %>" class="text-decoration-none">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 <%= @active_tab == 'target' ? 'border-warning' : '' %>"
           style="<%= @active_tab == 'target' ? 'border-left: 4px solid #f0ad4e !important;' : '' %>">
        <div class="card-body text-center">
          <div style="font-size:1.5rem">🎯</div>
          <div class="fw-bold" style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#f0ad4e"><%= number_with_delimiter(@target["count"]) %></div>
          <div class="small fw-bold">追蹤品牌＋有買</div>
          <div class="text-muted small">未追蹤 Chloe</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <%# ✅ 兩邊都追蹤 %>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <a href="<%= ig_audience_path(tab: 'both') %>" class="text-decoration-none">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 <%= @active_tab == 'both' ? 'border-success' : '' %>"
           style="<%= @active_tab == 'both' ? 'border-left: 4px solid #5cb85c !important;' : '' %>">
        <div class="card-body text-center">
          <div style="font-size:1.5rem">✅</div>
          <div class="fw-bold" style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#5cb85c"><%= number_with_delimiter(@both["count"]) %></div>
          <div class="small fw-bold">兩邊都追蹤＋有買</div>
          <div class="text-muted small">核心受眾</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <%# 📌 只追 Chloe %>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <a href="<%= ig_audience_path(tab: 'chloe_only') %>" class="text-decoration-none">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 <%= @active_tab == 'chloe_only' ? 'border-primary' : '' %>"
           style="<%= @active_tab == 'chloe_only' ? 'border-left: 4px solid #337ab7 !important;' : '' %>">
        <div class="card-body text-center">
          <div style="font-size:1.5rem">📌</div>
          <div class="fw-bold" style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#337ab7"><%= number_with_delimiter(@chloe_only["count"]) %></div>
          <div class="small fw-bold">追蹤 Chloe＋有買</div>
          <div class="text-muted small">未追蹤品牌帳號</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <%# ⚪ 兩邊都沒追蹤 %>
  <div class="col-md-3 col-6">
    <a href="<%= ig_audience_path(tab: 'neither') %>" class="text-decoration-none">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100 <%= @active_tab == 'neither' ? '' : '' %>">
        <div class="card-body text-center">
          <div style="font-size:1.5rem">⚪</div>
          <div class="fw-bold" style="font-size:1.6rem; color:#888"><%= number_with_delimiter(@neither["count"]) %></div>
          <div class="small fw-bold">有買</div>
          <div class="text-muted small">兩邊都未追蹤</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

<%# ── 明細名單 ── %>
<%
  tab_meta = {
    "target"     => { label: "🎯 追蹤品牌＋有買＋未追蹤 Chloe",   color: "#f0ad4e", buyers: @target },
    "both"       => { label: "✅ 兩邊都追蹤＋有買（核心受眾）",       color: "#5cb85c", buyers: @both },
    "chloe_only" => { label: "📌 追蹤 Chloe＋有買＋未追蹤品牌",      color: "#337ab7", buyers: @chloe_only },
    "neither"    => { label: "⚪ 有買但兩邊都未追蹤",                 color: "#888",    buyers: @neither }
  }
  current = tab_meta[@active_tab]
  buyers  = current[:buyers]["buyers"] || []
%>

<div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"
       style="border-left: 4px solid <%= current[:color] %>;">
    <span class="fw-bold"><%= current[:label] %>（<%= buyers.size %> 人）</span>
    <a href="<%= ig_audience_export_path(tab: @active_tab) %>" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
      <i class="fa fa-download mr-1"></i> 下載 CSV
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body p-0">
    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="table table-hover table-sm mb-0">
        <thead class="thead-light">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-3">IG 帳號</th>
            <th>客戶姓名</th>
            <th>Email</th>
            <th class="text-right">訂單數</th>
            <th class="text-right">總消費</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% buyers.first(200).each do |b| %>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-3">
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/<%= b['ig'] %>" target="_blank" class="text-muted small">
                  @<%= b["ig"] %>
                </a>
              </td>
              <td><%= b["name"] %></td>
              <td class="text-muted small"><%= b["email"] %></td>
              <td class="text-right"><%= b["orders"] %></td>
              <td class="text-right fw-bold">NT$<%= number_with_delimiter(b["amount"].to_i) %></td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
          <% if buyers.size > 200 %>
            <tr>
              <td colspan="5" class="text-center text-muted small py-2">
                顯示前 200 筆，完整名單請下載 CSV（共 <%= buyers.size %> 筆）
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<% end %>
